---
import { localeFromPath } from '@portfolio/i18n';
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import SecretSanta from '../../components/santa/SecretSanta';
---
<ToolLayout title="Secret Santa" seoTitle="Free online Secret Santa generator with wish lists" description="Draw names for your gift exchange, share one link, and let everyone see who they give to and add a wish list. No accounts." category="Events" image="santa" kind="LifestyleApplication" app festive>
  <SecretSanta locale={localeFromPath(Astro.url.pathname)} client:load />
  <div slot="guide" class="flex flex-col gap-8">
    <div class="prose-copy"><h2>One link for the whole group.</h2><p>Write the names, add any couples who shouldn’t draw each other, and create the Secret Santa. Share the group link: each person picks their name, opens their gift to see who they give to, and adds a wish list.</p></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>How are names drawn?</summary><div class="prose-copy"><p>Nobody draws themselves, and nobody draws the person who drew them, so there are no swaps between two people. A pair you exclude never draws each other in either direction. The draw uses secure random numbers on the server, and every valid result is equally likely; with many exclusions it finds any valid draw instead, and tells you if there is none.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Can the organizer see who got whom?</summary><div class="prose-copy"><p>No. The organizer sees who joined and how many wishes each person has, never the draw. Each person sees only who they give to and that person’s wish list.</p><p>There are no accounts, so each person picks their own name. If someone picks a name that isn’t theirs, the real person finds it taken and the organizer can free it.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>How do wish lists work?</summary><div class="prose-copy"><p>Each person adds wishes one by one, or pastes a list from their notes: every line becomes a wish, and bullets, numbers, and checkboxes are removed. Whoever drew you sees your list, so they know what to get you; you never see who drew you.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Where is the data stored, and for how long?</summary><div class="prose-copy"><p>Names, the draw, and wish lists are stored in this site’s database. Access works with private links saved in each browser; only fingerprints of those links are stored. A group is deleted 30 days after the exchange date, or 30 days after the last draw if there is no date. The organizer can delete it at any time.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>What if someone joins late or changes device?</summary><div class="prose-copy"><p>The organizer can edit the people and draw again. Everyone who stays keeps their name and wish list, but gets a new person to give to. To use another device, copy your personal link and open it there.</p></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</ToolLayout>
